---
description: Israeli full female name — one given name and one surname (נועה לוי). The surname comes from the SAME list as the male one: Israeli surnames do not inflect for gender, so there is no feminine surname list in this pack and its absence is the design.
generator: tdc
locale: he
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="he.person.female.firstName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="he.person.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.f}} ${{p.l}}</data>
